---- MODULE RuleCheck ----
\* Generated by chart-to-tla.mjs from rule-check.mmd.
\* Each region is one variable and each transition label is one action.
\* Once you add guards and variables from the real code, this file is the source.
\* statechart.mjs from-chart rule-check.mmd keeps it, checks it, and compares it with the chart.

VARIABLES rule, generated
vars == <<rule, generated>>

\* Region Rule
ruleStates == {"Active", "Excluded", "NotInPackage", "Pending", "Removed"}
\* Region Generated
generatedStates == {"Generated", "NotGenerated"}

TypeOK ==
    /\ rule \in ruleStates
    /\ generated \in generatedStates

Init ==
    /\ rule = "NotInPackage"
    /\ generated = "NotGenerated"

\* adopt pack
AdoptPack ==
    /\ \/ (rule = "NotInPackage" /\ rule' = "Active")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<generated>>

\* upgrade adds rule
UpgradeAddsRule ==
    /\ \/ (rule = "NotInPackage" /\ rule' = "Pending")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<generated>>

\* accept and sync
AcceptAndSync ==
    /\ (rule \in {"Pending"} \/ (generated = "NotGenerated" /\ rule = "Pending"))
    /\ \/ (rule = "Pending" /\ rule' = "Active")
       \/ (rule \notin {"Pending"} /\ UNCHANGED rule)
    /\ \/ (generated = "NotGenerated" /\ rule = "Pending" /\ generated' = "Generated")
       \/ (~((generated = "NotGenerated" /\ rule = "Pending")) /\ UNCHANGED generated)

\* decide to exclude
DecideToExclude ==
    /\ \/ (rule = "Pending" /\ rule' = "Excluded")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<generated>>

\* exclude in manifest
ExcludeInManifest ==
    /\ \/ (rule = "Active" /\ rule' = "Excluded")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<generated>>

\* include again
IncludeAgain ==
    /\ \/ (rule = "Excluded" /\ rule' = "Active")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<generated>>

\* upgrade removes rule
UpgradeRemovesRule ==
    /\ (rule \in {"Active", "Pending", "Excluded"} \/ generated \in {"Generated"})
    /\ \/ (rule = "Active" /\ rule' = "Removed")
       \/ (rule = "Pending" /\ rule' = "Removed")
       \/ (rule = "Excluded" /\ rule' = "Removed")
       \/ (rule \notin {"Active", "Pending", "Excluded"} /\ UNCHANGED rule)
    /\ \/ (generated = "Generated" /\ generated' = "NotGenerated")
       \/ (generated \notin {"Generated"} /\ UNCHANGED generated)

\* sync
Sync ==
    /\ \/ (generated = "NotGenerated" /\ rule = "Active" /\ generated' = "Generated")
       \/ (generated = "Generated" /\ ~(rule = "Active") /\ generated' = "NotGenerated")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<rule>>

Next == AdoptPack \/ UpgradeAddsRule \/ AcceptAndSync \/ DecideToExclude \/ ExcludeInManifest \/ IncludeAgain \/ UpgradeRemovesRule \/ Sync

Spec == Init /\ [][Next]_vars

\* 保留中のルールが lint で指摘を出す
PendingSilent == ~(rule = "Pending" /\ generated = "Generated")

\* パッケージから消えたルールが、生成物に残って指摘を出す
GoneLingers == ~(rule = "Removed" /\ generated = "Generated")

====
